{
  "description": "Robson House PPRU is a specialist therapeutic and educational placement for children who cannot attend mainstream school because of social, emotional and mental health needs, or who have been permanently excluded from school. The proposals set out in this document seek to expand capacity at Robson House by repurposing surplus office space to provide a new classroom, therapy room, quiet room and staff facilities. Although the works are predominantly internal in nature, this Design and Access Statement seeks planning permission for minor alterations to the courtyard fronting\nStanhope Street to improve circulation, as well as the installation of a new rooftop VHU to serve the refurbished accommodation.",
